    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate's gross claims outstanding at the start of 2019 were GBP 830.4m. Overall movements during 2019 were mixed: there were improvements on certain 2018 large loss exposures (Camp and Woolsey wildfires) and deterioration on others (Typhoon Jebi and the Lurssen Shipyard loss). The syndicate also had gross exposure to 2019 typhoons (Hagibis and Faxai) which were noted as grossly material but net immaterial. No single, explicit gross prior-year movement figure (total gross prior-year release or strengthening) is stated in the notes in isolation, and the presence of RITC and SPA arrangements may distort simple movement measures.",
